ArchiveEntry "Level C minor M2>0 on Routh, via q-power decomposition (documented; NOT machine-closed)"

/*
 * GOAL: M2>0 on the Routh region {D1>b>0, K>D1*b}, the lone Sylvester minor that
 * theorem_levelC_M2 cannot close monolithically. TRUE and fully decomposed:
 *   Routh is parametrized bijectively by D1=b+p, K=D1*b+q (b,p,q>0); the substituted
 *   M2 grouped by powers of q is c0(b,p)+c1(b,p)q+...+c5(b,p)q^5, and EVERY c_k has
 *   all-nonnegative (b,p)-coefficients (min coeff >=1). So c0>0 and each T_k=c_k*q^k>=0.
 *
 * Every subproblem is INDIVIDUALLY proven/fast in KeYmaera X:
 *   - c0>0 (2-var):                       PROVED 54ms
 *   - T_k=c_k*q^k>=0 (3-var):             PROVED ~116ms
 *   - abstract sign-assembly lemma        PROVED 92ms (lemma_sign_assembly.kyx)
 *     (nonneg-weighted sum of nonpositives, here T0>0 & T_k>=0 -> sum>0)
 *
 * KeYmaera X STATUS: NOT machine-closed. Assembling these into ONE proof
 * (cut the 6 T_k facts, instantiate the linear lemma, conclude propositionally)
 * was built and runs, but TIMES OUT across 8 attempts that fixed five separate
 * plumbing issues (Z3 re-expansion -> abstract lemma; interpolation identity ->
 * grouped goal; degree-5 lemma -> linear lemma; bundled premise QE -> separate
 * cuts; monolith goal leaking into each show-branch QE -> hideR). With all of
 * those fixed the leaves are fast, yet the full assembly still times out --
 * KeYmaera X manipulating the large instantiated formulas + the propositional
 * assembly is the remaining wall. The MATH is settled and every piece proven;
 * only the machine assembly of the decomposed pieces eludes this Z3-only backend
 * (a Mathematica QE or different proof-assembly tooling would close it).
 *
 * This is M2>0 on Routh (grouped form below); with theorem_levelC_M1/M3 (PROVED)
 * it gives Sylvester positive-definiteness of P_poly, the Level C certificate.
 */

ProgramVariables
  Real b; Real p; Real q;
End.

Problem
  \forall b \forall p \forall q (
    ( b>0 & p>0 & q>0 ) -> (4*b^10 + 16*b^9*p + 25*b^8*p^2 + 8*b^8 + 19*b^7*p^3 + 24*b^7*p + 7*b^6*p^4 + 26*b^6*p^2 + 4*b^6 + b^5*p^5 + 12*b^5*p^3 + 8*b^5*p + 2*b^4*p^4 + 5*b^4*p^2 + b^3*p^3) + (20*b^8 + 66*b^7*p + 82*b^6*p^2 + 30*b^6 + 47*b^5*p^3 + 69*b^5*p + 12*b^4*p^4 + 53*b^4*p^2 + 10*b^4 + b^3*p^5 + 15*b^3*p^3 + 13*b^3*p + b^2*p^4 + 4*b^2*p^2)*q + (40*b^6 + 102*b^5*p + 90*b^4*p^2 + 42*b^4 + 31*b^3*p^3 + 65*b^3*p + 3*b^2*p^4 + 27*b^2*p^2 + 8*b^2 + 2*b*p^3 + 5*b*p)*q^2 + (40*b^4 + 70*b^3*p + 34*b^2*p^2 + 26*b^2 + 3*b*p^3 + 20*b*p + p^2 + 2)*q^3 + (20*b^2 + 18*b*p + p^2 + 6)*q^4 + (4)*q^5 > 0 )
End.

End.
